Package: parkeze-ble
Depends: kmod-bluetooth, bluez-utils, mosquitto-client-ssl
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: Bluetooth beacons, heard beside the LoRaWAN radio.
 Scans passively with the board's Bluetooth radio or a USB dongle and sends
 the parking beacons it hears to parkeze.net, which decodes them with the
 device type's codec. Off until turned on from parkeze.net or the console.
